{"id":8859736408263,"title":"Personalized Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Quilt Sets - Tree of Life in","handle":"personalized-celtic-tree-of-life-quilt-quilt-sets-tree-of-life-in","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome to Jeminise, where comfort meets personalized style. Our \"Tree of Life\" Quilt Set is designed to bring a touch of meaningful artistry to your home. Featuring the symbolic Yggdrasil design, this quilt set combines beauty with functionality, making it a perfect addition to your bedding collection or a thoughtful gift for cherished loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSelected Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features an amazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to fit various bed sizes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal present for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or any special occasion, perfect for family and friends.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Functional and decorative, suitable for use on a bed, wrapping up on the sofa, or for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water, microfibers dry quickly and become fluffier with air drying (without heat).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQui